# Canonical repo

Work only in this workspace: `proposal-builder-main` → https://github.com/IanDev-cmd/proposal-builder-

Do not open, edit, clone, or deploy from `ProductionENV-Proposal_engine-`, `IanDev-cmd/ProductionENV-Proposal_engine-`, or any second copy of the Flask engine.

| Layer | Path |
| --- | --- |
| UX (Nexus SPA) | `artifacts/workspace-suite` |
| Backend (Flask PDF + workspace JSON) | `artifacts/pdf-engine` |
| PDF templates, inserts, fonts, vessels | `artifacts/pdf-engine/assets` |
| Browser DB | IndexedDB `nexus-workspace` (SPA) |
| Engine DB | `artifacts/pdf-engine/data/workspace` |

Render: both `weott-quote-builder` and `weott-proposal-engine` deploy from this repo (`render.yaml`). Keep paid starter on the engine and database, never Free:

- `weott-quote-builder` → static CDN (no `plan` field; Render rejects `starter` on static sites)
- `weott-proposal-engine` → `plan: starter` ($7/mo)
- `weott-nexus-workspace` → `plan: basic-256mb` (Postgres paid starter)

Never keep a separate engine GitHub as source of truth.

Do not rebuild multi-package PDFs or swap inserts. Overlay-only proposals.